      "text": "他说了三次新疆之行",
      "start": 164.39999999999998,
      "end": 166.51999999999998,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1009,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3228
    },
    {
      "text": "让我体会到真正的理解是",
      "start": 166.51999999999998,
      "end": 168.6,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1009,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3228
    },
    {
      "text": "必须亲眼所见",
      "start": 168.6,
      "end": 171.06,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1009,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3228
    },
    {
      "text": "而不是道听途说",
      "start": 171.06,
      "end": 173.26,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1009,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3228
    },
    {
      "text": "必须要去亲眼见证实地考察",
      "start": 173.26,
      "end": 176.76,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1235,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "text": "对吧",
      "start": 176.76,
      "end": 177.44,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1235,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "text": "你不必须和不是他俩语义相反",
      "start": 177.44,
      "end": 180.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1235,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "text": "所以你这里面道听途说",
      "start": 180.0,
      "end": 182.28,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1235,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "text": "你就反推呗",
      "start": 182.28,
      "end": 183.42,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1235,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "text": "反推的话就是说",
      "start": 183.42,
      "end": 185.51999999999998,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1235,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "text": "我们不要只靠别人转述的传闻",
      "start": 185.51999999999998,
      "end": 188.95999999999998,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1235,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "text": "我们要亲眼所见",
      "start": 188.95999999999998,
      "end": 191.84,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1235,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "text": "所以道听途说",
      "start": 191.84,
      "end": 193.01999999999998,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1235,
      "compression_ratio": 1.3827
    },
    {
      "text": "他就是指什么",
