      "end": 212.02,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1262,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4045
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么的话题皆谈相议",
      "start": 212.02,
      "end": 213.84,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1262,
      "compression_ratio": 1.4045
    },
    {
      "text": "那么他说了榜样",
